---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import architectureVisual from '../../assets/deadliner/shared-core-background.png'
const rows = [
  {
    name: '界面体验',
    current: 'Compose · SwiftUI · ArkUI，保留各端原生体验',
    legacy: '各平台分别开发原生界面',
  },
  {
    name: '任务与习惯',
    current: '共用领域模型与业务逻辑，功能更一致',
    legacy: '各端独立实现，功能与行为存在差异',
  },
  {
    name: '数据与同步',
    current: '共享数据核心与合并规则，连接平台服务',
    legacy: '各端分别维护数据与同步逻辑',
  },
  {
    name: 'Lifi AI',
    current: '通过共享接口接入任务管理 Agent',
    legacy: 'AI 能力由各端分别接入',
  },
]
---

<section class="architecture-section" id="architecture">
  <div class="architecture-wrap">
    <header class="architecture-hero">
      <Image
        class="architecture-backdrop"
        src={architectureVisual}
        widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1672]}
        sizes="(max-width: 1180px) 100vw, 1180px"
        format="webp"
        alt=""
        aria-hidden="true"
        width="1672"
        height="941"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <div class="architecture-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">跨平台混合原生开发</p><h2>
          <span class="brand">Deadliner<span class="kmp-badge">KMP</span></span><br
          /><span class="headline">各有手感。内里一致。</span>
        </h2><p class="intro">原生界面，加上共享核心。<br />用得熟悉，功能也更齐。</p>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="native-stack">
      <div class="native-platforms">
        <div><span>Android</span><b>Jetpack Compose</b></div><div>
          <span>iOS</span><b>SwiftUI</b>
        </div><div><span>HarmonyOS</span><b>ArkUI</b></div>
      </div><div class="core-layer">
        <span>Kotlin Multiplatform</span><b>任务 · 习惯 · ViewModel · 数据与同步</b><small
          >SQLDelight · Ktor · 平台原生能力</small
        >
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="comparison-heading">
      <h3>这次升级，<br />从里面开始。</h3><p>
        相较于 Deadliner Legacy，<br />大幅提升跨平台功能一致性。
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="performance">
      <div>
        <span class="metric">35 <span>%+</span></span><b>列表加载性能提升*</b>
      </div><div
        class="performance-bars"
        aria-label="列表加载性能提升 35% 以上；条形长度为对比示意"
      >
        <div><span>Deadliner KMP</span><i class="new-bar"></i></div><div>
          <span>Deadliner Legacy</span><i class="old-bar"></i>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="comparison-scroll">
      <table>
        <caption>Deadliner KMP 与 Deadliner Legacy 架构对比</caption><thead
          ><tr
            ><th scope="col">升级在哪儿</th><th scope="col"
              ><span class="table-brand">Deadliner <sup>KMP</sup></span></th
            ><th scope="col">Deadliner Legacy</th></tr
          ></thead
        ><tbody
          >{
            rows.map((row) => (
              <tr>
                <>
                  <th scope="row">{row.name}</th>
                  <td>{row.current}</td>
                  <td>{row.legacy}</td>
                </>
              </tr>
            ))
          }</tbody
        >
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="metric-note">
      * 数据由项目提供，对比 Deadliner Legacy 的列表加载性能。测试设备：小米 17（HyperOS 4
      / Android 17）、华为 Pura X（HarmonyOS 7）。实际表现随设备、任务量与版本而异。
    </p>
    <a
      class="core-link"
      href="https://github.com/DeadlinerStudio/DeadlinerCore"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noreferrer">了解 DeadlinerCore <span>↗</span></a
    >
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .architecture-section {
    background: #101013;
    color: #f5f5f7;
  }
  .architecture-wrap {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 110px 36px;
  }
  .architecture-hero {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    min-height: 560px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin: -110px -36px 0;
    padding: 90px 36px;
  }
  .architecture-backdrop {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -1;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    mask-image:
      linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, #000 12%, #000 80%, transparent),
      linear-gradient(to right, transparent, #000 12%, #000 88%, transparent);
    mask-composite: intersect;
  }
  .architecture-copy {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 620px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    color: #a1a1a6;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin: 0 0 25px;
    font-weight: 550;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(37px, 5vw, 65px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.22;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .brand {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
    padding-right: 49px;
  }
  .kmp-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    border: 1px solid #74747e;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 4px 6px;
    font-weight: 550;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .headline {
    display: block;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 44px);
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    color: #a1a1a6;
    margin-top: 9px;
  }
  .intro {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #a1a1a6;
    margin: 22px 0 0;
  }
  .native-stack {
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 24px auto 100px;
    padding: 30px 36px 36px;
    background: #242427;
    border-radius: 28px;
  }
  .native-platforms {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 26px;
  }
  .native-platforms > div {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 20px 8px 35px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .native-platforms > div:after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 50%;
    height: 22px;
    border-left: 1px solid #494954;
  }
  .native-platforms span,
  .native-platforms b {
    display: block;
  }
  .native-platforms span {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #a1a1a6;
  }
  .native-platforms b {
    font-size: 21px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-weight: 550;
  }
  .core-layer {
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid #414652;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 30px 16px;
    background: linear-gradient(130deg, #17232e, #1d1c28);
  }
  .core-layer > span {
    color: #8cc5f3;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .core-layer b {
    display: block;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 550;
    margin: 12px 0;
  }
  .core-layer small {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #a1a1a6;
  }
  .comparison-heading {
    display: flex;
    align-items: end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 30px;
  }
  .comparison-heading h3 {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .comparison-heading p {
    color: #a1a1a6;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .performance {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.7fr 1.3fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 60px;
    margin: 55px 0 65px;
    padding: 40px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #34343b;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #34343b;
  }
  .metric {
    font-size: 100px;
    line-height: 1;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.07em;
    color: #83bafa;
  }
  .metric > span {
    font-size: 48px;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }
  .performance b {
    display: block;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-top: 16px;
    color: #c2c2c7;
  }
  .performance-bars > div + div {
    margin-top: 26px;
  }
  .performance-bars span {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #a1a1a6;
  }
  .performance-bars i {
    display: block;
    height: 10px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    border-radius: 20px;
  }
  .new-bar {
    width: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #397fcd, #a4cfff);
  }
  .old-bar {
    width: 74%;
    background: #4f4f59;
  }
  .comparison-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    text-align: left;
    table-layout: fixed;
  }
  caption {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip-path: inset(50%);
  }
  th,
  td {
    padding: 23px 24px 23px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #34343b;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  thead th {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 550;
    padding-bottom: 28px;
  }
  th:first-child {
    width: 20%;
  }
  tbody th {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #d4d4d8;
  }
  td {
    width: 40%;
    color: #d4d4d8;
  }
  td:last-child {
    color: #86868e;
  }
  .table-brand {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .table-brand sup {
    font-size: 9px;
    border: 1px solid #74747e;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 2px 4px;
    margin-left: 2px;
  }
  .metric-note {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #85858d;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 25px 0;
  }
  .core-link {
    color: #8cc5f3 !important;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .core-link span {
    margin-left: 5px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 650px) {
    .architecture-wrap {
      padding: 75px 24px;
    }
    .architecture-hero {
      min-height: 590px;
      margin: -75px -24px 0;
      padding: 75px 24px 290px;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .architecture-backdrop {
      object-fit: contain;
      object-position: center bottom;
      mask-image: linear-gradient(
        to bottom,
        transparent 30%,
        #000 58%,
        #000 85%,
        transparent
      );
    }
    .eyebrow {
      font-size: 11px;
    }
    h2 {
      font-size: 36px;
    }
    .headline {
      font-size: 27px;
    }
    .brand {
      padding-right: 41px;
    }
    .kmp-badge {
      font-size: 10px;
    }
    .intro {
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .native-stack {
      margin: 20px 0 60px;
      padding: 20px 14px 24px;
      border-radius: 22px;
    }
    .native-platforms {
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .native-platforms span {
      font-size: 10px;
    }
    .native-platforms b {
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    .core-layer {
      padding: 25px 12px;
    }
    .core-layer b {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .core-layer small {
      font-size: 9px;
    }
    .comparison-heading {
      display: block;
    }
    .comparison-heading h3 {
      font-size: 34px;
    }
    .comparison-heading p {
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
    .performance {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
      margin: 32px 0;
      padding: 30px 0;
    }
    .metric {
      font-size: 82px;
    }
    .metric > span {
      font-size: 40px;
    }
    .performance b {
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .performance-bars span {
      font-size: 10px;
    }
    table {
      min-width: 540px;
    }
    thead th {
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    th,
    td {
      font-size: 11px;
      padding-right: 18px;
    }
    th:first-child {
      width: 17%;
    }
    .metric-note {
      font-size: 9px;
    }
  }
</style>
